# Opening scene (slide 1 pre-roll): real data only.
#  #1 = average of the two deposited EMD-72202 half maps (unsharpened), #2 = deposited model PDB 9Q3L.
# 0-3 s: contour tightens from noise level (0.02) to the 80% atom-inclusion level (0.0678): the dimer emerges.
# 3-6 s: map turns translucent while the model (helices as cylinders) fades in.  6-14 s: model only, rotating.
# 1920x1080, 30 fps, 420 frames. Run: chimerax --nogui --offscreen --exit opening.cxc
cd /home/ditsa/cryo-ai-seminar-data
open emd72202/val/avg_unsharpened.mrc
open /home/ditsa/Documents/BCH561_AI_cryoEM/data/9q3l.cif
set bgColor #05080C
lighting full
lighting shadows false
material dull
graphics silhouettes true width 2 color #05080C
volume #1 step 1 style surface level 0.02 color #8FB8CC transparency 0
hide #2 atoms
hide #2 pbonds
cartoon #2
cartoon style #2 modeHelix tube sides 24 xsection oval width 2.2 thick 0.6
color #2/A #2E5BFF target c
color #2/B #4FD1E8 target c
show #2:P0G,A1CNS atoms
style #2:P0G stick
style #2:A1CNS sphere
color #2:P0G #F4F7F9 target a
color #2:A1CNS #F2B347 target a
transparency #2 100 target ca
view #2
turn x -90
turn y 90
view #2
zoom 0.85
movie record size 1920,1080 supersample 3
turn y 0.6 420
perframe "volume #1 level $1" range 0.02,0.0678 frames 90
wait 90
perframe "volume #1 transparency $1" range 0,0.85 frames 90
perframe "transparency #2 $1 target ca" range 100,0 frames 90
wait 90
perframe "volume #1 transparency $1" range 0.85,1 frames 30
wait 30
hide #1 models
wait 210
movie stop
movie encode /home/ditsa/cryo-ai-seminar-data/sim/opening_raw.mp4 framerate 30 quality highest
